{"c":[{"id":"b892001397ffa997","sum":"2026-10-21: HNSW dropped (CREATE INDEX can restore it). Dedup-before-join was 153 ms on 2.0 (1.3 s join-first). DROP+CHECKPOINT 0.8 s, used blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). vss unloaded: file opened on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0; DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, and checkpoint worked.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"8a57d435513e6ce9","sum":"2026-10-21: operator dropped HNSW (a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Exact top-100 was 130 ms vs 34 ms indexed. DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161453 to 6846 (37.4 GiB). COPY FROM DATABASE then made a 506 MB file in 5.2 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T024529Z-428ab7ddc503aa7e","text":"Live-copy measurements 2026-10-21 (DuckDB 2.0.0): DROP INDEX + CHECKPOINT took 0.8 s and cut used blocks 161,453 to 6,846 (37.4 GiB freed in the file); COPY FROM DATABASE then gave a 506 MB file in 5.2 s. Exact top-100 search: 130 ms median vs 34 ms HNSW.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T041848Z-871fed0b54c48740","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: drop the HNSW index (two-way door; a later CREATE INDEX can restore it). Reverses 'HNSW stays'. Exact top-100 over 133,793 vectors is 130 ms on 2.0.0. Needs an L4 milestone re-plan.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"a604a7266b9252d1","sum":"2026-10-21: dedup-before-join exact search was 153 ms on 2.0 (1.3 s join-first). A file with HNSW and vss unloaded opened on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, with or without a killed-embed wal, kept every row; DROP INDEX in a transaction, then insert and checkpoint, worked.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T042746Z-f215752aa66f27d4","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, DuckDB 1.5.4 and 2.0.0, vss never loaded (autoload off): a file with the HNSW index, with or without a .wal from a killed 1.5.4 embed, opens, keeps every row, runs exact array_cosine_distance, DROP INDEX in a transaction, insert, checkpoint.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043947Z-1bad7ee0aac20fca","text":"Measured 2026-10-21, live copy (133,793 vectors): exact semantic as join messages then QUALIFY row_number() takes 1.3 s on 2.0.0 (1.7 s on 1.5.4); group-by-min, LIMIT, then join messages takes 153 ms (205 ms). Role scope: 1.15 s vs 363 ms. Dedup before joining text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3ec88ef482f61022","sum":"No default connect loads vss (ro/rw, killed wal) on 1.5.4 or 2.0.0; shared vss. Zstd validity Uncompressed/Constant; check VARCHAR/JSON. Swap=phase B: A rehearsed; B day+ later: copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release. Top-100 220/160 ms (1.5.4/2.0.0).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7f7ac3203ac0de40","sum":"2026-10-21: default connects never load vss for HNSW (ro or rw, killed-embed wal) on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects share one instance and its vss. Validity segments stay Uncompressed or Constant under zstd; check VARCHAR/JSON segments. Zstd copy 288 MiB vs 483 without.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T043948Z-dab6d7cbfdabf68a","text":"Measured 2026-10-21: engine-default connects (autoload+autoinstall on) never load vss for a file with the HNSW index, ro or rw, with a killed embed's wal, on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0. Same-path connects in one process share one instance and its loaded vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T043949Z-fa23510e4a10474a","text":"pragma_storage_info lists VALIDITY segments under the column name, Uncompressed or Constant even with zstd forced; check zstd on VARCHAR/JSON segments. Live tables copy to 288 MiB with zstd vs 483 MiB without on 2.0.0 (measured 2026-10-21).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"099f55a26a5a6c59","sum":"2026-10-22: swap is check phase B. Phase A records rehearsed. Phase B, a day or more later: copy, verify, hard-link backup, replace. No swap release. Exact top-100 rank-cut-join: 220 ms on 1.5.4, ~160 ms on 2.0.0 (133,793 vectors); EXISTS 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T125611Z-032510e14baefd2f","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: the swap is phase B of the session-start check. Phase A records rehearsed; phase B runs at a later session start, at least a day after a rehearsed record of the same check version: copy again, verify, hard-link the backup, replace. No swap release.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T131311Z-231ef0e08e22e082","text":"Exact semantic top-100 over 133,793 vectors, measured 2026-10-22: rank (min distance per owner), cut, then join messages takes 220 ms on 1.5.4 and ~160 ms on 2.0.0; an EXISTS orphan guard 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
